    <!-- 20261015 Claude (B18b, SG decision 2026-10-15): ODH History of Employment Status (4.212) with a
         null-flavored value. The generic nullFlavor -> dataAbsentReason translation is kept, but
         odh-EmploymentStatus (hl7.fhir.us.odh 1.1.0) sets dataAbsentReason to max 0, so the meta.profile
         claim is DROPPED for that case and an INFO comment is emitted inside the Observation instead. A
         real value keeps meta.profile exactly as before (L3 is the shape pin / negative control).
